  <article class="tp-article">

  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> divide your shoulder circumference by your waist. The average man scores about <strong>1.26</strong>; above <strong>1.35</strong> looks athletic, and <strong>1.618</strong> (the golden ratio, or Adonis index) is the classic ideal.</p></div>

  <nav class="pg-toc pg-toc--split" id="page-contents" aria-label="Inside this shoulder-to-waist ratio guide">
